# This workspace is scratch. Only AiKi/ is the real project.
*
!AiKi/
!AiKi/**
!.gitignore

# GitHub only reads workflows from the ROOT of the repository, and the root of
# this repository is this directory, not AiKi/. So the workflow lives here and
# has to be un-ignored explicitly, or the whitelist above swallows it and CI
# silently does not exist. That is how it went missing once already.
!.github/
!.github/**

.gstack/

# Vercel CLI project link
.vercel

# Scratch directories that tooling drops inside the project.
AiKi/.superpowers/
